    "In Fastmail, open Settings, then Privacy & Security, then Manage API tokens. Make a new token with Email access, Email submission so you can send, and Masked Email and Contacts if you use them.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "af": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maak in Fastmail Instellings oop, dan Privaatheid en sekuriteit, dan Bestuur API-tokens. Maak 'n nuwe token met E-pos-toegang, E-posindiening sodat jy kan stuur, en Masked Email en Kontakte as jy hulle gebruik."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "في Fastmail، افتح الإعدادات، ثم الخصوصية والأمان، ثم إدارة رموز API. أنشئ رمزًا جديدًا مع إذن البريد الإلكتروني، وإرسال البريد لتتمكن من الإرسال، وMasked Email وجهات الاتصال إذا كنت تستخدمها."
          }
        },
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fastmail-এ সেটিংস, তারপর Privacy & Security, তারপর Manage API tokens খুলুন। Email অ্যাক্সেস, পাঠানোর জন্য Email submission, আর দরকার হলে Masked Email ও Contacts দিয়ে নতুন টোকেন বানান।"
          }
        },
        "ca": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A Fastmail, obre Configuració, després Privadesa i seguretat, després Gestionar testimonis d'API. Crea un testimoni nou amb accés al Correu, Enviament de correu perquè puguis enviar, i Masked Email i Contactes si els fas servir."
          }
        },
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ve Fastmailu otevřete Settings, pak Privacy & Security a pak Manage API tokens. Vytvořte nový token s přístupem Email, Email submission pro odesílání a Masked Email a Contacts, pokud je používáte."
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I Fastmail skal du åbne Indstillinger, derefter Anonymitet og sikkerhed og så Administrer API-tokens. Opret en ny token med adgang til E-mail, E-mailafsendelse, så du kan sende, og Masked Email og Kontakter, hvis du bruger dem."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffne in Fastmail „Einstellungen“, dann „Datenschutz & Sicherheit“, dann „API-Tokens verwalten“. Erstelle einen neuen Token mit Zugriff auf E-Mail, E-Mail-Versand zum Senden sowie Masked Email und Kontakte, falls du sie nutzt."
          }
        },
        "el": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Στο Fastmail, ανοίξτε Settings, μετά Privacy & Security, μετά Manage API tokens. Φτιάξτε νέο token με πρόσβαση σε Email, Email submission για να στέλνετε, και Masked Email και Contacts αν τα χρησιμοποιείτε."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En Fastmail, abre Ajustes, luego Privacidad y seguridad, luego Gestionar tokens de API. Crea un token nuevo con acceso a Correo, Envío de correo para poder enviar, y Masked Email y Contactos si los usas."
          }
        },
        "fa": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "در Fastmail، تنظیمات، سپس حریم خصوصی و امنیت، سپس مدیریت توکن‌های API را باز کنید. توکن جدیدی با دسترسی ایمیل، ارسال ایمیل برای اینکه بتوانید بفرستید، و Masked Email و مخاطبین اگر از آن‌ها استفاده می‌کنید بسازید."
          }
        },
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avaa Fastmailissa Asetukset, sitten Yksityisyys ja turvallisuus ja sitten API-tunnusten hallinta. Luo uusi tunnus, jolla on Sähköposti-oikeus, Sähköpostin lähetys, jotta voit lähettää, sekä Masked Email ja Yhteystiedot, jos käytät niitä."
          }
        },
        "fil": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sa Fastmail, buksan ang Settings, tapos Privacy & Security, tapos Manage API tokens. Gumawa ng bagong token na may Email access, Email submission para makapagpadala ka, at Masked Email at Contacts kung ginagamit mo ang mga ito."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dans Fastmail, ouvrez Réglages, puis Confidentialité et sécurité, puis Gérer les jetons API. Créez un jeton avec l’accès E-mail, Envoi d’e-mails pour pouvoir envoyer, et Masked Email et Contacts si vous les utilisez."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ב-Fastmail, פתח את ״הגדרות״, אחר כך ״פרטיות ואבטחה״, ואז ״ניהול אסימוני API״. צור אסימון חדש עם גישה לדוא״ל, שליחת דוא״ל כדי שתוכל לשלוח, ו-Masked Email ואנשי קשר אם אתה משתמש בהם."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fastmail में, सेटिंग्ज़, फिर Privacy & Security, फिर Manage API tokens खोलें। Email ऐक्सेस, भेजने के लिए Email submission, और ज़रूरत हो तो Masked Email और Contacts के साथ नया टोकन बनाएँ।"
          }
        },
        "hr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "U Fastmailu otvorite Settings, zatim Privacy & Security, zatim Manage API tokens. Izradite novi token s pristupom Email, Email submission za slanje te Masked Email i Contacts ako ih koristite."
          }
        },
        "hu": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A Fastmailben nyissa meg a Settings, majd a Privacy & Security, majd a Manage API tokens részt. Hozzon létre új tokent Email hozzáféréssel, Email submission jogosultsággal a küldéshez, valamint Masked Email és Contacts jogosultsággal, ha használja őket."
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Di Fastmail, buka Settings, lalu Privacy & Security, lalu Manage API tokens. Buat token baru dengan akses Email, Email submission agar bisa mengirim, serta Masked Email dan Contacts jika Anda menggunakannya."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In Fastmail, apri Impostazioni, poi Privacy e sicurezza, poi Gestisci token API. Crea un nuovo token con accesso a Email, Invio email per poter inviare, e Masked Email e Contatti se li usi."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fastmailで「設定」>「プライバシーとセキュリティ」>「APIトークンを管理」の順に開きます。「Email」アクセス、送信用の「Email submission」、使用する場合は「Masked Email」と「Contacts」を付けた新しいトークンを作成してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fastmail에서 설정 > 개인 정보 보호 및 보안 > API 토큰 관리를 여십시오. Email 접근, 보내기용 Email submission, 사용하는 경우 Masked Email과 Contacts를 포함한 새 토큰을 만드십시오."
          }
        },
        "ms": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dalam Fastmail, buka Settings, kemudian Privacy & Security, kemudian Manage API tokens. Buat token baharu dengan akses Email, Email submission supaya anda boleh menghantar, dan Masked Email serta Contacts jika anda menggunakannya."
          }
        },
        "nb": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I Fastmail åpner du Innstillinger, deretter Personvern og sikkerhet og så Administrer API-tokens. Lag en ny token med tilgang til E-post, E-postinnsending så du kan sende, og Masked Email og Kontakter hvis du bruker dem."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open in Fastmail Instellingen, dan Privacy en beveiliging, dan API-tokens beheren. Maak een nieuw token met toegang tot E-mail, E-mail versturen zodat je kunt versturen, en Masked Email en Contacten als je die gebruikt."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "W Fastmail otwórz Settings, potem Privacy & Security, potem Manage API tokens. Utwórz nowy token z dostępem Email, Email submission do wysyłania oraz Masked Email i Contacts, jeśli ich używasz."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No Fastmail, abra Configurações, depois Privacidade e segurança e então Gerenciar tokens de API. Crie um novo token com acesso a E-mail, Envio de e-mail para poder enviar, e Masked Email e Contatos se você os usar."
          }
        },
        "ro": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "În Fastmail, deschide Settings, apoi Privacy & Security, apoi Manage API tokens. Creează un token nou cu acces la Email, Email submission ca să poți trimite, plus Masked Email și Contacts dacă le folosești."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "В Fastmail откройте Settings, затем Privacy & Security, затем Manage API tokens. Создайте новый токен с доступом Email, Email submission для отправки, а также Masked Email и Contacts, если вы ими пользуетесь."
          }
        },
        "sk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vo Fastmaile otvorte Settings, potom Privacy & Security a potom Manage API tokens. Vytvorte nový token s prístupom Email, Email submission na odosielanie a Masked Email a Contacts, ak ich používate."
          }
        },
        "sr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "У Fastmail-у отворите Settings, затим Privacy & Security, па Manage API tokens. Направите нови токен са приступом Email, Email submission да бисте могли да шаљете, и Masked Email и Contacts ако их користите."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öppna Inställningar i Fastmail, sedan Integritet och säkerhet och sedan Hantera API-tokens. Skapa en ny token med åtkomst till E-post, E-postinlämning så att du kan skicka, och Masked Email och Kontakter om du använder dem."
          }
        },
        "sw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Katika Fastmail, fungua Mipangilio, kisha Faragha na Usalama, kisha Dhibiti tokeni za API. Tengeneza tokeni mpya yenye ruhusa ya Barua pepe, Kutuma barua pepe ili uweze kutuma, na Masked Email na Waasiliani ukizitumia."
          }
        },
        "te": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fastmailలో, సెట్టింగ్‌లు, ఆ తర్వాత Privacy & Security, ఆ తర్వాత Manage API tokens తెరవండి. Email యాక్సెస్, పంపడానికి Email submission, మరియు మీరు ఉపయోగిస్తే Masked Email, Contactsతో కొత్త టోకెన్ తయారు చేయండి."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ใน Fastmail ให้เปิด Settings แล้ว Privacy & Security แล้ว Manage API tokens สร้างโทเค็นใหม่ที่มีสิทธิ์ Email, Email submission เพื่อให้ส่งได้ และ Masked Email กับ Contacts หากคุณใช้"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fastmail'de Ayarlar'ı, ardından Gizlilik ve Güvenlik'i, sonra API token'larını yönet'i açın. E-posta erişimi, gönderebilmek için E-posta gönderimi ve kullanıyorsanız Masked Email ile Kişiler içeren yeni bir token oluşturun."
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "У Fastmail відкрийте Settings, потім Privacy & Security, потім Manage API tokens. Створіть новий токен із доступом Email, Email submission для надсилання, а також Masked Email і Contacts, якщо ви ними користуєтеся."
          }
        },
        "ur": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fastmail میں سیٹنگز کھولیں، پھر رازداری اور سیکیورٹی، پھر API ٹوکنز کا نظم کریں۔ ای میل رسائی، بھیجنے کے لیے ای میل سبمشن، اور اگر استعمال کرتے ہیں تو Masked Email اور رابطوں کے ساتھ نیا ٹوکن بنائیں۔"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trong Fastmail, mở Cài đặt, rồi Privacy & Security, rồi Manage API tokens. Tạo token mới có quyền Email, Email submission để gửi thư, và Masked Email cùng Contacts nếu bạn dùng."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Fastmail 中,打开“Settings”,然后“Privacy & Security”,再打开“Manage API tokens”。创建一个新令牌,勾选 Email 访问权限、用于发送的 Email submission,如有使用,还要勾选 Masked Email 和 Contacts。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Fastmail 中,打開「Settings」,然後「Privacy & Security」,再打開「Manage API tokens」。製作一個新權杖,勾選 Email 取用權限、用於傳送的 Email submission,若有使用,也勾選 Masked Email 和 Contacts。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Mail App, open Admin, then API & webhooks, and make a new key with Read, Organise, Send and Delete for your mailboxes. Use your email address, the key as the password and your Mail App address as the server.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "af": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maak in Mail App Admin oop, dan API & webhooks, en maak 'n nuwe sleutel met Lees, Organiseer, Stuur en Skrap vir jou posbusse. Gebruik jou e-posadres, die sleutel as die wagwoord en jou Mail App-adres as die bediener."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "في Mail App، افتح الإدارة، ثم API وwebhooks، وأنشئ مفتاحًا جديدًا مع أذونات القراءة والتنظيم والإرسال والحذف لصناديق بريدك. استخدم عنوان بريدك، والمفتاح ككلمة سر، وعنوان Mail App كخادم."
          }
        },
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mail App-এ Admin, তারপর API & webhooks খুলুন, আর আপনার মেলবক্সের জন্য Read, Organise, Send ও Delete সহ নতুন কী বানান। আপনার ইমেল ঠিকানা, পাসওয়ার্ড হিসেবে কী আর সার্ভার হিসেবে আপনার Mail App ঠিকানা ব্যবহার করুন।"
          }
        },
        "ca": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A Mail App, obre Admin, després API & webhooks, i crea una clau nova amb Llegir, Organitzar, Enviar i Eliminar per a les teves bústies. Fes servir la teva adreça de correu, la clau com a contrasenya i l'adreça de Mail App com a servidor."
          }
        },
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "V Mail App otevřete Admin, pak API & webhooks a vytvořte nový klíč s oprávněními Read, Organise, Send a Delete pro své schránky. Použijte svou e-mailovou adresu, klíč jako heslo a adresu Mail App jako server."
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I Mail App skal du åbne Admin, derefter API & webhooks og oprette en ny nøgle med Read, Organise, Send og Delete til dine postkasser. Brug din e-mailadresse, nøglen som adgangskode og din Mail App-adresse som server."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffne in Mail App „Admin“, dann „API & webhooks“ und erstelle einen neuen Schlüssel mit Read, Organise, Send und Delete für deine Postfächer. Verwende deine E-Mail-Adresse, den Schlüssel als Passwort und die Adresse deiner Mail App als Server."
